{"steam_appid":1845250,"steam_name":"Rubinite","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1845250/492818183/626d85a52f78cda22aee5b2a4b5ce5e9a86bb6ce/1779341728/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1779342617","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257340519/3e385f57dbf8fa1f37c1f7b8504a6b408b8e8d02/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1779342617","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/ss_654b9bfbd9ed7a1edc2d86128161edf0334efcae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786527756","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/ss_194ad9fa7368833302eadbce2b95db8e0f3f2359.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786527756","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/ss_f90fa81fa1792762913b6f87f07ea9906ba9a323.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786527756","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/ss_667c410e3f5f5c5a8dffa4cd32bcd5cf66b72cd7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786527756","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/ss_aabf89f9e3068792dabbe3a93a863b804ba319c2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786527756"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rubinite is an extremely challenging boss rush action game set in a dark fairy tale world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key to combat is one distinctive core mechanic: Focus. Use Focus to read an enemy, <br>expose its weak point, and land a lethal strike. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Ruby, a princess on a journey of revenge to reclaim her home: <strong>The Scarlet Kingdom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/8f77a61c21f51537ab6b9966e76d8904.poster.avif?t=1786527756\" width=615 height=255 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/8f77a61c21f51537ab6b9966e76d8904.webm?t=1786527756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight the Bloodstained to the Death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruby’s blade alone will barely wound them. Find their weak points,<br>drive the lethal strike home, and make it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/46db7a9030286393cd64de5abd39c551.poster.avif?t=1786527756\" width=640 height=255 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/46db7a9030286393cd64de5abd39c551.webm?t=1786527756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your Bloodline: Both a Blessing and a Curse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To take back the Scarlet Kingdom, Ruby must face the Bloodstained in every form they take,<br> whether it be an ancient secret cult, undying parasites, or the source of a deadly plague. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grip your blade and challenge foes that grow deadlier with every step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/cb28c217fdea8ac5920533477552e16a.poster.avif?t=1786527756\" width=640 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/cb28c217fdea8ac5920533477552e16a.webm?t=1786527756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/cb28c217fdea8ac5920533477552e16a.mp4?t=1786527756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exquisite Pixel Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into beautifully crafted pixelated scenes, where the poignancy and grandeur of the Scarlet Kingdom come alive in every hazardous battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/1ec7a182c96b25922a83c865550eb4e2.poster.avif?t=1786527756\" width=640 height=255 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/1ec7a182c96b25922a83c865550eb4e2.webm?t=1786527756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Absorb Pureblood, Forge Talismans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Bloodstained you kill surrenders its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb it to grow stronger for the fight ahead, craft a wide range of Talismans, <br>and build a combat style that's entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/72d03f819ef8b6e6ee23e503212c5dcf.poster.avif?t=1786527756\" width=614 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/72d03f819ef8b6e6ee23e503212c5dcf.webm?t=1786527756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/72d03f819ef8b6e6ee23e503212c5dcf.mp4?t=1786527756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/a0346373cd66a1b4da6540783bca4095.apng?t=1786527756\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1845250/extras/a0346373cd66a1b4da6540783bca4095.poster.avif?t=1786527756\" class=\"bb_img\" width=615 height=130 /></picture></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Athlon X4 | Intel Core i5 4460<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 950 | AMD R7 370<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 | Intel i5 Skylake<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 970 | AMD RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["Cup Dog Games","GameWorks Ventures"],"publishers":["Cup Dog Games"],"release_date":"22 Jul, 2026"}